Tum ek senior product designer + senior full-stack developer ho. Mere existing AI chatbot “GuruAI” ko ek complete Perplexity-style AI answer engine me convert karo.

PROJECT:
- Product name: GuruAI
- Owner / brand: HarshGuruJi
- Website: https://webguruji.online
- App URL: https://ai.webguruji.online
- Purpose: Students aur learners ke liye Hindi + English AI answer engine — study, coding, GK, research, notes, exam prep aur general questions.
- Target users: Indian students, school/college learners, self-learners.
- Tone: helpful, simple, trustworthy, educational.
- Languages: Hindi + English.

CORE PRODUCT VISION:
GuruAI sirf ek chatbot nahi hoga. Ye ek AI answer engine hoga:
1. User question type karega.
2. GuruAI web search karega.
3. Trusted sources collect karega.
4. Clear, structured answer stream karega.
5. Answer me numbered inline citations [1], [2], [3] dikhaye.
6. Right side ya bottom me source cards dikhaye.
7. Follow-up questions suggest kare.
8. Har search ek Thread me save ho.
9. User thread continue kar sake, save kar sake, share kar sake.
10. Web, Android app aur Windows desktop exe — teeno par same UI aur same data sync ho.

IMPORTANT:
Perplexity jaisa UI aur UX banao, lekin GuruAI ka apna branding, colors, logo aur student-focused features rakho.
Perplexity ka exact logo, exact text, exact code ya copyrighted assets copy mat karo.
Sirf layout pattern, interaction pattern aur product behavior inspired rakho.

=== 1. CROSS-PLATFORM ARCHITECTURE ===

Build one shared product across:

1. Web app:
   - Next.js 14 App Router + React + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS.
   - URL: https://ai.webguruji.online

2. Android app:
   - Use Capacitor or React Native WebView wrapper around the same Next.js web app.
   - Same UI, same account, same threads, same premium plan.
   - Android app must support:
     - Push notifications
     - Voice input
     - File upload
     - Share sheet
     - Deep links
     - Offline banner
     - Safe-area insets
     - Dark mode

3. Windows desktop app:
   - Use Electron or Tauri.
   - Package as GuruAI-Setup.exe for Windows.
   - Same web UI inside desktop shell.
   - Desktop app must support:
     - Native window controls
     - System tray
     - Global shortcut, for example Ctrl + Shift + G
     - Auto-update
     - Local file upload
     - Remember signed-in user
     - Deep links
     - Offline detection
     - Windows 10 and Windows 11 support

SHARED BACKEND:
- Supabase for auth, database, storage and realtime sync.
- Same user account works on web, Android and desktop.
- Threads, saved answers, collections, files, preferences and subscription status must sync instantly.
- Use responsive shared components so UI remains visually identical across all platforms.

