=== 4. THREAD / ANSWER PAGE UI ===

Har question ek Thread me open ho.

Thread layout:
- Top header:
  - GuruAI logo.
  - Thread title.
  - Mode badge: Search / Deep Research / Academic / Coding.
  - Model selector.
  - Share button.
  - Save to Collection button.
  - More options menu.
- Main answer area:
  - User question at top.
  - GuruAI answer below it.
  - Answer must support Markdown, headings, bullet points, tables, images, code blocks, and links.
  - Inline citations like [1], [2], [3] must be clickable.
  - Clicking a citation opens the source.
- Below answer:
  - Related follow-up questions.
  - Copy answer.
  - Regenerate answer.
  - Share answer.
  - Save answer.
  - Like / dislike feedback.
- Bottom composer:
  - Same search bar style.
  - User follow-up question type kar sake.
  - Thread context maintain ho.

Answer quality rules:
- Answer short paragraphs, headings, bullet points aur tables use kare.
- Important facts ke saath citation number ho.
- Code answer me proper syntax highlighting ho.
- Hindi question par Hindi answer de, English question par English answer de.
- Mixed language handle kare.
- Confusing question par clarifying question poochhe.
- Answer ke end me “Sources” section ho.

