=== 13. STATES — SAB HANDLE KARO ===

Empty state:
- Search-first home screen.
- Suggested prompts.
- Mode chips.

Searching state:
- Animated status text.
- Source cards loading.
- Skeleton answer blocks.

Streaming state:
- Answer progressively stream ho.
- Stop generation button.
- Inline citations appear as sources are used.

Error state:
- “Kuch galat ho gaya. Kripya dobara try karein.”
- Retry button.
- Switch model option.
- Human support link.

No result state:
- “Is topic par reliable sources nahi mile.”
- Alternative question suggestions.

Limit reached state:
- Upgrade card.
- Sign-in option.

Offline state:
- “Aap offline hain.”
- Cached threads accessible.
- New search disabled with clear message.

=== 14. RESPONSIVE RULES ===

